{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "users-collection-v1",
    "name": "Users API",
    "description": "Comprehensive user management endpoints\n\n## Overview\n- User profile management\n- User event interactions\n- Advanced querying and filtering\n\n### Authentication\n- All endpoints require valid JWT\n- Obtain JWT via Authentication API\n\n### Query Capabilities\n- Pagination\n- Sorting\n- Filtering\n- Advanced search options",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. User Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Users - Basic",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Users retrieved successfully', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const users = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(users).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(users.length).to.be.at.most(10);",
                  "})"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{JWT}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve list of users\n\n### Features\n- Default pagination (10 items)\n- Requires authentication\n- Returns basic user information"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Users - Advanced",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Filtered users retrieved successfully', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const users = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(users).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    if (users.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.expect(users[0]).to.have.property('email');",
                  "    }",
                  "})"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{JWT}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users?page={{currentPage}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&sortBy={{sortBy}}&sortOrder={{sortOrder}}&role=artist&status=active",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"],
              "query": [
                {"key": "page", "value": "{{currentPage}}"},
                {"key": "pageSize", "value": "{{pageSize}}"},
                {"key": "sortBy", "value": "{{sortBy}}"},
                {"key": "sortOrder", "value": "{{sortOrder}}"},
                {"key": "role", "value": "artist"},
                {"key": "status", "value": "active"}
              ]
            },
            "description": "Advanced user listing with filtering and sorting\n\n### Query Parameters\n- `page`: Current page number\n- `pageSize`: Number of items per page\n- `sortBy`: Field to sort by\n- `sortOrder`: Sort direction\n- `role`: Filter by user role\n- `status`: Filter by user status"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. User Profile",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get User by ID",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('User retrieved successfully', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const user = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(user).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.expect(user).to.have.property('email');",
                  "    pm.environment.set('retrievedUserId', user.id);",
                  "})"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{JWT}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{userId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve detailed user profile\n\n### Features\n- Returns comprehensive user information\n- Requires authentication\n- User can only retrieve own or admin-accessible profiles"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User Profile",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('User updated successfully', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const user = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(user.name).to.equal('Updated Name');",
                  "    pm.expect(user).to.have.property('updatedAt');",
                  "})"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{JWT}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Updated Name\",\n    \"profileImage\": \"https://example.com/new-profile.jpg\",\n    \"preferences\": {\n        \"musicGenres\": [\"rock\", \"jazz\"],\n        \"eventNotifications\": true\n    }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{userId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Partially update user profile\n\n### Update Capabilities\n- Change name\n- Update profile image\n- Modify user preferences\n- Requires authentication\n- User can only update own profile"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. User Events",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get User Events - Basic",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('User events retrieved successfully', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const events = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(events).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(events.length).to.be.at.most(10);",
                  "})"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{JWT}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/events",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{userId}}", "events"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve user's events\n\n### Features\n- Default pagination (10 events)\n- Returns basic event information\n- Requires authentication"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User Events - Filtered",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Filtered user events retrieved successfully', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const events = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(events).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    events.forEach(event => {",
                  "        pm.expect(event.status).to.equal('upcoming');",
                  "        pm.expect(new Date(event.startDate)).to.be.above(new Date());",
                  "    });",
                  "})"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{JWT}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/events?status=upcoming&startDate={{currentDate}}&genre=rock&sortBy=startDate&sortOrder=asc",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{userId}}", "events"],
              "query": [
                {"key": "status", "value": "upcoming"},
                {"key": "startDate", "value": "{{currentDate}}"},
                {"key": "genre", "value": "rock"},
                {"key": "sortBy", "value": "startDate"},
                {"key": "sortOrder", "value": "asc"}
              ]
            },
            "description": "Advanced event filtering for user\n\n### Query Parameters\n- `status`: Filter by event status\n- `startDate`: Events from this date forward\n- `genre`: Filter by music genre\n- `sortBy`: Field to sort events\n- `sortOrder`: Sort direction"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Error Scenarios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Unauthorized User Access",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Unauthorized access prevented', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "})"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{JWT}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/999/events",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "999", "events"]
            },
            "description": "Attempt to access another user's events\n\n### Expected Behavior\n- 403 Forbidden\n- Prevents unauthorized data access"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
